nt",["obj_D32R0101_bfsw2_6","_0394"]],["ApplyMovement",["obj_player","_039C"]],["WaitMovement",[]],["WaitFollowingPokemonMovement",[]],["ToggleFollowingPokemonMovement",["1"]],["FollowingPokemonMovement",["48"]],["Return",[]],["FaceSouth",[]],["EndMovement",[]],["FaceEast",[]],["EndMovement",[]],["FaceWest",[]],["EndMovement",[]],["WalkNormalNorth",["3"]],["WalkOnSpotNormalWest",[]],["EndMovement",[]],["SimpleNPCMsg",["msg_0103_D32R0101_00032"]],["End",[]],["SimpleNPCMsg",["msg_0103_D32R0101_00033"]],["End",[]],["SimpleNPCMsg",["msg_0103_D32R0101_00034"]],["End",[]],["SimpleNPCMsg",["msg_0103_D32R0101_00035"]],["End",[]]]},"messages":{"msg_0103_D32R0101_00000":"Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\\rThis is your first visit?\\nRight this way, please!\\r","msg_0103_D32R0101_00001":"Oh! You have a Vs. Recorder!\\nHow nice!\\rWe upgrade Vs. Recorders for first-time\\nvisitors for Battle Frontier use.\\rI’ll borrow yours for a moment.\\rLet’s see... Slide open this part here,\\nand ticka-tacka-kachunk there!\\rAll done!\\nHere you go.\\r","msg_0103_D32R0101_00002":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder was\\nupgraded.","msg_0103_D32R0101_00003":"Our other staff will be pleased to\\nexplain how the individual facilities\\fof the Battle Frontier operate.\\rI can go over general topics.\\nDo you have any questions? {YESNO 0}","msg_0103_D32R0101_00004":"Which topic should I explain? {YESNO 0}","msg_0103_D32R0101_00005":"The Battle Frontier has five facilities\\ndedicated to battling.\\rAt the Battle Tower, the objective is\\nto beat seven Trainers in a row.\\rAt the Battle Hall, you may keep battle\\nrecords of individual Pokémon.\\rAt the Battle Factory, you must win\\nconsecutive battles with rentals.\\rThe Battle Castle forces Trainers to\\nmanage Castle Points to advance.\\rAnd finally, the Battle Arcade is where\\nrandom luck triggers events.\\rYou can try any of these facilities!\\r","msg_0103_D32R0101_00006":"The battles at the five Battle Frontier\\nfacilities are held under special rules.\\rFirst and foremost, no Exp. Points\\ncan be earned.\\rConsequently, the Pokémon battling\\nhere will not level up.\\rIf the Level 50 rule is chosen,\\nPokémon of higher levels will be\\ftemporarily reduced to Lv. 50.\\rPokémon under Lv. 50 will be entered\\nwithout an upward level adjustment.\\r","msg_0103_D32R0101_00007":"Battle Points are usually referred to\\nas BP.\\rBP are points that are used only in\\nthe Battle Frontier.\\rBP are awarded for meeting certain\\nperformance goals at the various\\fBattle Frontier facilities.\\rBP can be exchanged for prizes at\\nthe Exchange Service Corner.\\r","msg_0103_D32R0101_00008":"The Exchange Service Corner is\\ncomprised of two tents straight\\fahead past here.\\rThere, you may exchange your BP for\\na wide variety of prizes.\\rPlease do visit it!\\r","msg_0103_D32R0101_00009":"The Performance Monitor shows Trainer\\ndata, such as the previous record and\\fthe best record to date.\\rYou will find one near the reception\\ncounter in each facility.\\r","msg_0103_D32R0101_00010":"We hope you enjoy your visit!","msg_0103_D32R0101_00011":"","msg_0103_D32R0101_00012":"","msg_0103_D32R0101_00013":"","msg_0103_D32R0101_00014":"","msg_0103_D32R0101_00015":"","msg_0103_D32R0101_00016":"","msg_0103_D32R0101_00017":"Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\\rShould I explain how the\\nBattle Tower works? {YESNO 0}","msg_0103_D32R0101_00018":"The Battle Tower is the building at the\\nback of the Battle Frontier.\\rThe object here is to enter a team of\\ndifferent Pokémon and battle on until\\fyou lose.\\r","msg_0103_D32R0101_00019":"We hope you enjoy your visit!","msg_0103_D32R0101_00020":"Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\\rShould I explain how the\\nBattle Factory works? {YESNO 0}","msg_0103_D32R0101_00021":"The Battle Factory is at the upper-\\nright corner of the Battle Frontier.\\rThere, you engage in a knockout\\ntournament with rented Pokémon.\\rThe goal is to keep winning for\\nas long as possible.\\rEvery time you win a match, you may\\ntrade one of your Pokémon for one of\\fthe opponent’s Pokémon.\\r","msg_0103_D32R0101_00022":"We hope you enjoy your visit!","msg_0103_D32R0101_00023":"Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\\rShould I explain how the\\nBattle Hall works? {YESNO 0}","msg_0103_D32R0101_00024":"The Battle Hall is at the upper-left\\ncorner of the Battle Frontier.\\rHere, you enter one Pokémon of your\\nchoosing for one-on-one battles.\\rThe objective is to keep your winning\\nstreak going as long as possible.\\r","msg_0103_D32R0101_00025":"We hope you enjoy your visit!","msg_0103_D32R0101_00026":"Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\\rShould I explain how the\\nBattle Castle works? {YESNO 0}","msg_0103_D32R0101_00027":"The Battle Castle is at the lower-left\\ncorner of the Battle Frontier.\\rHere, you are provided with Castle\\nPoints, CP, that you must manage.\\rThe CP are used for healing Pokémon,\\nrenting items or Berries, and so on.\\rThe objective is to keep a winning\\nstreak alive while managing your CP.\\r","msg_0103_D32R0101_00028":"We hope you enjoy your visit!","msg_0103_D32R0101_00029":"Welcome to the Battle Frontier!\\rShould I explain how the\\nBattle Arcade works? {YESNO 0}","msg_0103_D32R0101_00030":"The Battle Arcade is at the lower-right\\ncorner of the Battle Frontier.\\rHere, a game board is activated\\nbefore every match.\\rDepending on what comes up on the\\ngame board, an event takes place.\\rSome events will be good to the\\nchallenger, while others won’t be.\\rThe challenger may even avoid having\\nto battle at all.\\rThe objective is to keep a winning\\nstreak alive as long as possible.\\r","msg_0103_D32R0101_00031":"We hope you enjoy your visit!","msg_0103_D32R0101_00032":"The Battle Frontier is up ahead!\\nI have explored places all over the\\fworld, but nothing compares to the\\fexcitement I feel right now!\\rWhat kinds of Trainers will I see?\\nWhat battles will I experience?\\rIt’s a whole new adventure for me!","msg_0103_D32R0101_00033":"The five facilities of the Battle\\nFrontier are...\\rTower.\\rHall.\\rCastle.\\rFactory.\\rAnd Arcade.\\rHow do you make an acronym out of\\nthat? THCFA?\\rRearrange those letters, maybe?\\nFATCH! CHAFT!\\r...Nope! Nothing works!\\nDidn’t anyone think of this?!","msg_0103_D32R0101_00034":"The Vs. Recorder is sure nifty!\\rChecking the Frontier Record\\nwill tell you how much BP you have.","msg_0103_D32R0101_00035":"My dream is to battle Palmer of the\\nBattle Tower.\\rI want to record it for posterity on\\nmy Vs. Recorder.\\rBut I left my Vs. Recorder\\nat home... I’m heartbroken!"},"initTriggers":[{"var":"VAR_UNK_40E6","value":0,"script":"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_000 + 1"}],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_011 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_007":7,"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_008":8,"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_009":9,"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_010":10,"_EV_scr_seq_D32R0101_011":11,"obj_D32R0101_gsman1":0,"obj_D32R0101_gsoldman1":1,"obj_D32R0101_explore":2,"obj_D32R0101_bfsw2":3,"obj_D32R0101_bfsw2_2":4,"obj_D32R0101_bfsw2_3":5,"obj_D32R0101_bfsw2_4":6,"obj_D32R0101_bfsw2_5":7,"obj_D32R0101_bfsw2_6":8,"obj_D32R0101_gswoman2":9}}
